OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAfter a dry
OL,6,Fstart east before cloud and outbreaks
OL,7,Fof light rain or drizzle push in from
OL,8,Fthe west. This will become heavy at
OL,9,Ftimes in the northwest towards morning.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FA few bright spells in the
OL,12,Feast at first otherwise cloudy with
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain, heavy at times in
OL,14,Fthe west, spreading east in the
OL,15,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
